	"notice": "Use the included MIDI conversion cable for DIN connections or USB-C for MIDI to a computer or supported USB MIDI device. Configure transmit channels and clock routing in the connection settings. BLE MIDI must be routed through operating-system MIDI support before browser detection. Track, scale and octave settings change key behavior; step keys are not assigned a universal drum-note map. Exact browser MIDI port names are not verified; select this profile manually. The selected-control schematics are illustrative. Keys and panel controls remain unbound because channel, octave, mode and assignable functions must be checked against the instrument setup. This is a partial hardware and setup profile, not a complete MIDI implementation.",
